them about the services that we provide and talk&nbsp;
to them about our plans for moving the district&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:29.440
forward i'm really pleased to say that we've&nbsp;
got a couple more events coming up in the next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:35.840
few weeks we have one in one in Shirland coming&nbsp;
up in April and then again we're going to Barlow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:41.120
in May the details will be on the screen but&nbsp;
please do come along to those events if you're in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:45.680
the area and you want to find out more about what&nbsp;
the what the district council offers and our plans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:50.000
for taking the district forward moving forward we&nbsp;
do want to speak to you we want to be a listening&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:55.200
council we want to make sure that the things&nbsp;
that we do back in these buildings here reflect&nbsp;&nbsp;

